mulator \ud83d\ude8c\u2728\nYOUR ULTIMATE REALISTIC VR BUS EXPERIENCE!\n\n\ud83c\udf06 DRIVE 5 UNIQUE BUSES with 4 FREE SKINS each! Master 12 story levels + 10 challenging parking trials across 3 massive maps:\n\u2705 Downtown Metropolis (City Chaos!)\n\u2705 Cross-Country Highway (Open-Road Freedom!)\n\u2705 Glacier Peaks (Snowy Forest Thrills!)\n\n\ud83d\udd25 KEY FEATURES:\n\ud83d\ude8c LIVE THE BUS LIFE: Pick up/drop off passengers, refuel \u26fd, manage timings!\n\ud83c\udfac CINEMATIC MOMENTS: Exciting cutscenes after key missions!\n\ud83c\udfae IMMERSIVE MECHANICS: Realistic steering, weather effects & day/night cycles!\n\ud83c\udf0d OPEN-WORLD EXPLORATION: Roam freely in ultra-detailed environments!\n\ud83d\udcaf ZERO PAYWALLS: All buses + skins 100% FREE!\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 PERFECT FOR: #VRSimulation fans \ud83c\udfae #MetaQuest explorers \ud83c\udf10 #DrivingGame addicts \ud83d\udea6\n\n\ud83d\udc49 DOWNLOAD NOW!\nOnly on Meta Horizon Store\nSearch: \ud83d\udd0e \"VR Bus Simulator\"\n\nQuest 2/3/Pro | Comfort: Moderate\n\nSTART YOUR ENGINES & BECOME A VR BUS LEGEND! \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\ude8d", "short_description": "VR Bus Simulator \ud83d\ude8c\ud83c\udf1f\nDrive 5 Buses w/ FREE Skins!\n\u2705 22 Levels: 12 Story + 10 Parking Challenges!\n\u2705 3 HUGE Maps: City \ud83c\udf06, Highway \ud83d\udee3\ufe0f, Snowy Forest \u2744\ufe0f!\n\u2705 Live the Life: Refuel \u26fd, Pick Up/Drop Passengers \ud83e\uddd1\ud83e\udd1d\ud83e\uddd1, Cinematic Scenes \ud83c\udfac!\n\n#VRSimulation \ud83d\udd25 #MetaQuest \ud83c\udfae #BusDriver\n\n\ud83d\udc49 DOWNLOAD NOW!\nSearch: \ud83d\udd0e \"VR Bus Simulator\"\n*(Meta Quest 2/3/Pro | Comfort: Moderate)*\n\nYOUR ULTIMATE BUS ADVENTURE AWAITS! \ud83d\ude8d\ud83d\udca8\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/vrbussimulator/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http